cope\n\nIsolated same-owner DEV branch from physical original [SelfBody/S16/S50 join](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/commit/0ee72bc7fdabf26be905ba51779ecb1a1b1f1a99) (`DEV_WORLD_SELFBODY_S16_S50_JOIN_PASS`). Keeps original [SelfBody #632](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/issues/632), S49 Action/S16, S50 #645 producer, M/P1/L8, existing World evidence and main unchanged.\n\nNew `self_body_s50_next_epoch_passive.py` is a **read-only one-shot consumer** for original S49 `qualify(..., live_probe=...)` callback before L0 decision. It requires a prior typed same-Action SelfBody/S50 MotionCompanion, and accepts only a **new genuine native S49 correlated probe** in the same session, strictly higher native seq and (for original S49 action markers) later event index. Uses existing native Present and SelfBody/SelfWorld owner projections for a new source-matched Body/World epoch, with the prior S50 motion remaining separate diagnostic. Explicit `read_previous_motion()` / `take_readout_once()`; duplicate, wrong session, foreign request, old seq, invalid or missing probe reject/revoke without throwing into L0. No new packet, native probe, Action, policy, goal, P1, L10, M or memory owner.\n\nFocused negative-control tests, Python 3.12 CI. **This branch does not run an actual later physical L0 epoch.** Important live blocker: the successful prior S50 whole-sidecar `TRACE_END` is sealed on Node shutdown; after that a further same-session native `live_probe` cannot occur. Therefore a real B-style (native next epoch) measurement needs an *S50 owner-approved independently complete in-session source window* while client is still alive, and the original S49 next event; **or** an explicitly different A-style internal cognitive-epoch callback after shutdown that reads retained prior evidence but does not claim a fresh native Present. These must not be conflated. [Engineering handoff](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/blob/dev/selfbody-s50-next-epoch-passive-20261031/docs/selfbody-s50-next-epoch-dev-20261031.md).\n\nDEV_ONLY / NEXT_NATIVE_EPOCH_INTERFACE_OFFLINE / REAL_NEXT_EPOCH_NOT_OBSERVED / FULL_TICK_IDLE_UNPROVEN / QUALIFICATION_NO_GO / SCIENCE_NOT_RUN.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T11:11:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T11:22:17Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"93f233db0e4615a2f928d8e76e9cb5d87384ac2d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rinsakamo:dev/selfbody-s50-next-epoch-passive-20261031","ref":"dev/selfbody-s50-next-epoch-passive-20261031","repo":{"id":1371331707,"node_id":"R_kgDOUbzcew","name":"relay-self","full_name":"rinsakamo/relay-self","owner":{"login":"rinsakamo","id":272078660,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDeXRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272078660?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo","html_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Persistent cognition, present projection, and embodied control runtime for Relay.","homepage":"","language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["agent-architecture","autonomous-agents","cognitive-architecture","embodied-ai",